<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25551" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπλέω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-πλώω</span></b>  (q.v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sail through</i> a strait or gap,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				14.10.12
			</span></i>; sail <i>across,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μέγαράδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς Αἴγιναν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					122
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c.acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὸ πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.206d
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1976
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. βίον</span>
			<i>sail through</i> life, <i>make</i> life's <i>voyage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				85d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>flow through, pass,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ψαμμία σὺν τοῖσι οὔροισι δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
